TLDR ...

What to do now, depends on your goal:
If a) you want the challenge of solving a more difficult puzzle, just
put your thinking cap on and keep all of the Sokoban rules in mind;
If b) you just want to finish Sokoban for the loot, then count the
boulders and if you have enough go ahead and break one with a pickaxe
or wand of striking, or maybe you need to do some squeezing and if
that leaves you short of boulders then you'll just have to waste a
scroll of earth.

Just remember to consider the potential luck consequences and don't go
praying for food (or something) until you know you're safe.

